<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's KFA to seek 140,000 tonnes of soymeal.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's KFA to seek 140,000 tonnes of soymeal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Feed Association (KFA) has invited tenders for 140,000 tonnes of soymeal by 2:00 p.m. (0500 GMT) on Thursday, traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Traders said the KFA split the tenders into four positions.</p>
<p>However, sources said the KFA is expected buy about 110,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>Details for the tenders are as follows:</p>
<p> POSITION  TONNE   ETA	 ARRIVAL PORT</p>
<p>  One     30,000   May 30     Inchon</p>
<p>  Two     30,000   May 20     Ulsan/Kunsan</p>
<p>  Three   30,000   June 30    Inchon</p>
<p>  Four    50,000   June 20    Inchon/Kunsan</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
